<title>UK: SQUASH-BRITISH OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-BRITISH OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the British</p>
<p>Open squash championship on Saturday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>3-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat 2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) 5-15</p>
<p>15-12 17-14 15-2</p>
<p>Women1-Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat 4-Sue Wright</p>
<p>(England) 9-2 7-9 9-2 9-1</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>1-Michelle Martin (Australia) beat 10-Fiona Geaves (England)</p>
<p>9-4 9-0 9-1</p>
</text>
